<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Crestar Financial cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Crestar Financial cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Carole Berger said she cut her rating on Crestar Financial Corp to hold from buy, at the same time lowering her 1997 earnings per share view to $5.40 from $5.85.</p>
<p>-- Crestar said it would buy Citizens Bancorp in a $774 million stock swap.</p>
<p>-- Crestar shares were down 2-1/2 at 58-7/8. Citizens Bancorp soared 14-5/8 to 46-7/8.</p>
</text>
